# Claude Code project-local settings and plugins
# Local agent config. Third-party skills stay out; the repo-specific
# `kunskap` skill is tracked so the whole team gets it. Git will not descend
# into an excluded directory, so each level has to be re-included in turn —
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/kunskap/

# Responsive audit output (scripts kept, output not)
audit/screenshots/
audit/*.json

# ui-explore mockups + scratch (disposable, never commit)
.tmp/

# omvärldsbevakning: locally-held "already seen" ledger
.omvarld-state.json
